			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80200101,
					"content": "Wait a second... That person, it's... Dainsleif!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200102,
					"content": "Ah, it's you two...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200103,
					"content": "Oh, a friend of yours?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Atossa"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200104,
					"content": "Well, I'll leave you all to it, then. I should head back to the village to check up on Chief Amadhiah and the others, anyway. See you later!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Atossa"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200105,
					"content": "Yep! See you later, Atossa!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200106,
					"content": "Why do you always have to pop up out of nowhere like that!? Is it your life's mission in life to jumpscare us or something?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200107,
					"content": "It's hardly personal... or intentional, for that matter. As long as you and I are both in pursuit of the Abyss Order, we're bound to cross paths.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200108,
					"content": "Ah, so you're here to investigate the Abyss Order, then! That would explain the monsters you were fighting just now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200109,
					"content": "Naturally. Hold on... Are you not here for the same purpose?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200110,
						80200111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200110,
					"content": "We're also on their tail...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200112,
					"content": "Hm, no matter. It may have taken you a while to catch on, but I'm sure you've also realized by now... That there's something strange about this place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200113,
					"content": "The Abyss Order is most certainly planning something in this area... or worse, their plan could already be in motion.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200114,
					"content": "So you think the Abyss Order is behind the Hilichurl activity in the area?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200115,
					"content": "As things stand, I highly doubt that is their primary motive. I would imagine the increased Hilichurl activity is merely a byproduct of whatever it is they're really trying to accomplish.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200116,
					"content": "Still, the Hilichurl activity is causing a lot of problems for the people here. We should stick around for a while and protect the village, don't you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200117,
					"content": "The best way to protect them is by figuring out what the Abyss Order is truly planning. That is how we prevent further tragedy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200118,
						80200119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200118,
					"content": "Well, let's see what more we can learn from the villagers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200120,
					"content": "And you shall have them. I never intended to hide anything from you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200121,
					"content": "Don't worry... There should be ample time to talk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200119,
					"content": "And after that... You also owe us many answers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200111,
					"content": "But, I'll admit, we ran into them on accident.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200112
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
