						],
						"pointId": 330201535
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80200301,
					"content": "So you hid it way out here! Not an easy place to discover, that's for sure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200302,
					"content": "Well, let's go check to see if it's safe!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200303,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, wait...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200304,
					"content": "Hm?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200305,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200306,
					"content": "...We've no time to lose. Let's head inside.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200307,
					"content": "(What was Dain going to tell me just now...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200308,
					"content": "Hey, wait up!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 802004,
			"completionStepIds": [
				802009
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"802009",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 802009,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Dainsleif"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1138.109,
							201.003,
							2686.616
						],
						"pointId": 330400509
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1136.425,
							200.941,
							2686.6
						],
						"pointId": 330400545
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1136.996,
							201.048,
							2684.435
						],
						"pointId": 330400551
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80200122,
					"content": "You return to Vimara Village to gather intel based on what you've learned. You question the villagers until, eventually, the sky grows dark...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200123,
					"content": "Ah, so that was the commission that brought you here to Vimara Village...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200124,
					"content": "\"Someone who seems to only exist in people's memories\"... That is indeed quite intriguing. I would agree that it's unlikely you have a simple missing person's case on your hands. However, any possible connection to the Abyss Order is still unclear.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200125,
					"content": "It appears all we have by way of clues is increased Hilichurl activity, and that is certainly not much to go off of.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200126,
						80200127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200126,
					"content": "Well, then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200128,
					"content": "#Right! That mysterious voice {F#she}{M#he} heard in {F#her brother's}{M#his sister's} memory... The one who called himself a Sinner... Who is he?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200129,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200130,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, let me ask you this... Do you believe your sibling to have betrayed you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200131,
						80200132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200131,
					"content": "#I want to have faith in {M#her}{F#him}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200133,
					"content": "Hmm... I sense hesitation in your words. After all, you still haven't figured out the whole truth of what happened.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200134,
					"content": "There's still hope for the two of you to reconcile. Irreparable damage has not yet been done.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200135,
					"content": "The Sinner you wish to know about... His situation is different. He and his fellow sinners have long betrayed me, and long betrayed their nation.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200136,
					"content": "His name is Vedrfolnir, \"The Visionary.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200137,
					"content": "I'm loath to admit it, but... He is also my kin. My older brother.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200138,
					"content": "Your... brother?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200139,
						80200140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200139,
					"content": "What happened between the two of you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200141
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200141,
					"content": "There were five of them... The Five Sinners of Khaenri'ah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200142,
					"content": "\"The Wise\" Hroptatyr, \"The Visionary\" Vedrfolnir, \"Gold\" Rhinedottir, \"The Foul\" Surtalogi, and \"Rächer of Solnari\" Rerir.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200143,
					"content": "No matter how eroded my memory may become, I will never forget their names... One day... I shall have my vengeance.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200144,
					"content": "Wait! Some of those names sound really familiar... Rhinedottir is the one who created Albedo, Surtalogi is Skirk's master...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200145,
					"content": "And the one we just learned about... Dain's brother, Vedrfolnir... If he was the voice of the Sinner, then the one who inspired Chlothar to create the Abyss Order... was him!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200146,
					"content": "Somehow, everything is connected...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200147
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200147,
					"content": "(If that's true, then the stone slates we found in that ruin in Fontaine... The ones that outlined Fontaine's prophecy... That was likely Vedrfolnir's doing as well.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200148
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200148,
					"content": "They were once people of great esteem in Khaenri'ah, those who carried the hopes of the nation. They were the best of their peers, outstanding in their respective fields...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200149,
					"content": "The six of us, together... We should have been the ones to prevent the disaster, the ones to stop the Vinster King from continuing to rock the foundation of the world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200150,
					"content": "Yet, deep within, the five of them craved something more. They could not resist the call of the Abyss, and divided among themselves a power that could destroy the world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200151,
					"content": "So they became Sinners, but also transcendent beings, each in possession of world-shattering power.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200152,
					"content": "And when the cataclysm occurred, not one of them stood up in defense of their nation, not one came forward to prevent the tragedy... And for that, they shall never have my forgiveness.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200153,
						80200154
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200153,
					"content": "And then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200155
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200155,
					"content": "...Indeed. If they are not stopped, the day is sure to come when they will also betray the entire world.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200156,
						80200157
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200156,
					"content": "It must be hard to talk about all of this.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200158
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200158,
					"content": "Of course. As I said, I never intended to hide anything from you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200159
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200159,
					"content": "So, Dain, what have you been looking into all this time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200160
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200160,
					"content": "I've continued to investigate the questions surrounding the Loom of Fate. It's been quite some time since the initial operation was launched.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200161
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200161,
					"content": "By retrieving the eye of the first Field Tiller, we were able to stop part of their plan from coming to fruition...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200162
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200162,
					"content": "Oh, Paimon remembers! Weren't they gonna use it to corrupt Osial and make a god or something...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200163
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200163,
					"content": "Indeed... However, it's obvious that was just some kind of technical experiment...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200164
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200164,
					"content": "The eye was integral to their plan, yet somehow, despite failing to obtain it, they've skipped the experimental phase and found some other way to keep moving forward.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200165
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200165,
					"content": "There are many signs pointing to that effect...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200166
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200166,
					"content": "Then, what should we do? It's not too late, is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200167
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200167,
					"content": "Our most pressing concern... is to determine the purpose of the Loom of Fate. From there, we'll be able to deduce the Abyss Order's true objective.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200168
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200168,
					"content": "Based on the intel I've gathered so far, I suspect the Loom of Fate is related to the Ley Lines in some way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200169
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200169,
					"content": "The Ley Lines?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200170
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200170,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}, you were able to observe your sibling's memories last time, yes? I believe that was due to the fact that the Ley Lines in that area were unstable.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200171
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200171,
					"content": "My recent investigation has shown that Abyss Order activity in a particular area is usually followed by a series of issues with the Ley Lines.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200172
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200172,
					"content": "And one of the things that flows through the Ley Lines... are memories.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200173
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200173,
					"content": "Wait, then our commission here in Vimara Village... The person who seems to exist only in people's memories... Could it be connected?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200174
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200174,
					"content": "(Memories... Ley Lines... The Loom of Fate... The missing person that doesn't seem to exist...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200175
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200175,
					"content": "(What's the connection between all this?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200176
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200176,
					"content": "It's certainly possible. I'll join your investigation tomorrow. This missing person's case could very well turn out to be the key to unraveling these mysteries.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200177
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200177,
					"content": "Well, if we're teaming up with Dain again, we're gonna need all the energy we can get! Let's try investigating somewhere a little further away tomorrow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200401
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200401,
					"content": "*yawn*... So tired... Paimon used way too much brain juice yesterday. It's all Dain's fault, saying all that complicated stuff...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200402,
						80200403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200402,
					"content": "I didn't sleep well, either...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200404,
					"content": "Well, let's go find Dain. We've got a lot to do today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80200403,
					"content": "My head's a mess.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200157,
					"content": "But thank you for telling me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200158
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200154,
					"content": "My sibling came into contact with your brother.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200155
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200140,
					"content": "What really happened in Khaenri'ah back then?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200141
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200132,
					"content": "In a manner of speaking, yeah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80200127,
					"content": "How about the intel you promised me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80200128
					]
				}
			]
		},
